<h1><%= t("fun.title") %></h1>

<p><%= t("fun.introduction") %></p>

<h2>Character learning</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/fun/transcription">Transcription practice</a> — type through a text with your normal IME or the imported RIME dictionaries.</li>
  <li><a href="/fun/deconstruction">Character deconstruction</a> — look at a character and build an accepted IDS analysis.</li>
  <li><a href="/fun/components">Component lookup practice</a> — learn total strokes → first stroke → component.</li>
  <li><a href="/fun/make-a-character">Make a character</a> — freely build IDS structures and see which encoded characters they match.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Word games</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/fun/chengyu-jielong">成語接龍 Chengyu Jielong</a> — free-type a Chengyu chain against the imported Chinese, Japanese, Korean, and topolectal Wiktionary data.</li>
</ul>

